sentences.text:
8. Applicant shall abide by the following conditions under Section 438(2) of Cr.P.C:-
(a) Applicant shall make herself available for interrogation by a Police Officer as and when required;
(b) She shall not, directly or indirectly, make any inducement, threat or promise to complainant or witnesses;
(c) She shall not leave India without the previous permission of the Court; (d) She shall not commit similar offence, of which, she is accused or suspected.
9.

